{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-plays-in-the-sand-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "e264e321569435692daff293667cfd62abda82922a9298df046c35c4830da49f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8c6c9d527b9bfc072d61e09e7f8b260e254b1a6659446827e184bdcfba2b0ce5",
      "text": "悟空去海边\n玩沙",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4ba2c5ab51d31a22fc0f2cac1e522e605a6e9416adafe07e4b3730d44d10d5ac",
      "text": "悟空刚到海边，\n就蹲下来堆沙子。\n“我要堆一座大沙山！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ecc044581ccb6cc67ba274cc14d12903d2ee9aa0e9ab6b2458eb0df2e55382a",
      "text": "他装了满满一桶干沙。\n把桶一倒——\n哗啦，全散了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3207ba8dec09f9de56daca8ca1d6fc391291c0409222752011d416e1a6186962",
      "text": "八戒把桶往头上一扣。\n“嘿，新帽子！\n悟空，你也试试？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8c967ea9ec1ed66060a3f32f79fd7d587d14668a66e7659669e1bbb9fdbe4fad",
      "text": "敖丙提来一小桶水。\n“沙子太干啦，\n加点水试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "da82e713b829e028fbfa56415bf90a7a3bfd03a6e8f4d770c85108f4b447a175",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟，水倒多了。\n“哎呀，变成沙子汤啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7764878b69a6ec88f85cfe25cbde63893bd33977f5441a8d244afa2bccc2f830",
      "text": "悟空把桶一放。\n“怎么堆个沙山这么难呀！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec16fafdc2982ce08161c4fba201a64c02c2da08596ca6441ae0d71fa7749f13",
      "text": "沙僧说：“再来一次吧。”\n“先放干沙，再加一点水。”\n悟空点点头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4cc3b35d1afd67127a394c5f587bc8bc0a855f65fb1df29d056624e4aec2d62e",
      "text": "他们拌拌沙子，再捏一捏。\n嘿，湿沙捏成团了！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "06f3bc2b080fa8af6f6247b0b9b867dd158a45dae2ad9f11083d8145f8ca3f8d",
      "text": "往桶里装，装满啦！\n再拍一拍，拍结实。\n“好了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "31a19b99c327dca125fc071ad0cc1fd28e4fc68adff190218b4771e0cacbdf5c",
      "text": "小桶倒扣在沙地上。\n轻轻一提——\n“这回没塌！一座小沙塔！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b45b8a3fb3a8b24b62eccf3b7685fc5a9432142abec5aa5baaaf6918567ff91",
      "text": "悟空在旁边堆座小山。\n八戒把桶倒扣过来，\n做了个圆圆的“沙蛋糕”。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "be0a82fdcb3defa230d0eb445ab67264e0957c33d83c6fef92c86ba7348a9a85",
      "text": "敖丙绕着沙塔挖一圈，\n再倒上水。\n小水池也有啦！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "23c0fdfc157b8a3d51bab912ca7f55fbddd4098dc1e307adab00be98c0f40aaa",
      "text": "八戒问：“里面住着谁？”\n“一个小国王呀！”\n悟空笑嘻嘻地说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05c0ff438faf47af575dde24c3f3dd689772c0396a13be8b332c96f551452e14",
      "text": "大家收好桶和小铲子。\n沙僧拿来小刷子，\n帮悟空刷掉身上的沙。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5609ca56a994b7a72aa126eef3d341a20ce3929b256cbfaf0afe553a5fb62019",
      "text": "悟空脱下鞋，倒了倒。\n哗啦！\n“鞋里还藏着一座小沙山！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e47bfd76283cf8f242247af1e2a096d7a4f84d95f25500387c8fb7d678be320",
